          "filename": "Eigg (29189382277).jpg",
          "caption": "I rather enjoyed this group of flags and signs - part financed by the EU (\"Europe and Scotland making it work together\" - will Westminster work to benefit rural communities post-Brexit, or just continue to invest in London and the SE?), Isle of Eigg Electrification Project (the island previously relied on diesel generators - it now has it's own grid, 95% powered by renewable energy - hence the 'renewable energy, yes please' flag). An assemblage that is indicative of the extraordinary character of the thriving Eigg community. Oh, and the narrow road sign!",
